  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Viet Nam Climate-Smart Fruit Value Chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This&#xa0;Activity in Viet Nam will aim to support improvements in productivity, quality and inclusivity in the passion fruit value chain, to enable smallholder farmers, particularly from ethnic minority households, to increase their incomes, while improving resilience of their farming systems to future climate scenarios.</narrative>
  </description>
